AMENDEDANALYSIS
Thisbill:
I. Requires a dental hygienist to be trained and to pass an examination before being permitted
toadministerlocalanesthesia.
II. Requires that any dentist who applies for licensure is a graduate of a school that is
recognized by the Commission on Dental Accreditation (CODA) and holds the degree of D.D.S. or
D.M.D.

